      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This application claims two crystalline forms and inhaled formulations of a the selective phosphatidylinositol 3-kinase-δ inhibitor (PI3Kδ) inhibitor 6-(2-((4-amino-3-(3-hydroxyphenyl)-1H-pyrazolo[3,4-d]pyrimidin-1-yl)methyl)-3-(2-chlorobenzyl)-4-oxo-3,4-dihydroquinazolin-5-yl)-N, N-bis(2-methoxyethyl)hex-5-ynamide. These formulations are claimed to be useful in the treatment of respiratory diseases including asthma and chronic obstructive pulmonary disease."},
